WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:06.230
Infinite Ryvius

00:00:07.870 --> 00:00:11.740
Blue gave the go-ahead. We're
sending out the Vital Guarder! Hurry!

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:13.980
Isn't the Solid for separation
sequence ready yet?

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:15.580
What's taking the "sub" guys so long?

00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:18.100
They were only gathered moments
ago. Give them a little more time.

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:20.520
Hey! They want us to hurry up!

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:22.320
Then why don't you give us a hand?

00:00:22.690 --> 00:00:25.680
I don't wanna work in this
lame room. Bye! And good luck!

00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:27.260
Hey! Wait!

00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:28.760
What is it with that brat?

00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:30.520
S-Sorry 'bout him.

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:34.130
Execute the Vital Guarder's detachment
as soon as the reactor's released.

00:00:34.130 --> 00:00:36.030
Yuki! The timing of this is in your hands.

00:00:36.030 --> 00:00:37.070
All right.

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:40.090
Are you sure you understand? Our part
in this is to restrain the enemy.

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:42.370
Keep damage to a minimum.

00:01:05.930 --> 00:01:08.450
68 seconds to detachment of Lift-ship.

00:01:08.970 --> 00:01:11.070
Ryvius' energy supply is low.

00:01:11.070 --> 00:01:11.590
What?

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:37.680
Upon our arrival to Mars' vicinity, we
were attacked by an unidentified fleet.

00:01:38.600 --> 00:01:40.930
We can no longer avoid a battle.

00:01:40.930 --> 00:01:44.490
And from this point,
our true journey begins.

00:01:45.570 --> 00:01:47.040
Yes. From this point.

00:01:48.810 --> 00:01:52.610
Infinite Ryvius

00:01:53.210 --> 00:02:00.080
If you're going to walk, right here will be fine

00:02:01.080 --> 00:02:04.090
Although loneliness...

00:02:04.090 --> 00:02:08.420
...can sometimes be unbearable

00:02:08.930 --> 00:02:15.660
There's the benefit of not hurting anyone...

00:02:16.800 --> 00:02:20.740
...and the benefit of not being exposed...

00:02:20.740 --> 00:02:23.710
...and hurt by others as well

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:31.240
At the opposite side of the frozen sea...

00:02:32.020 --> 00:02:35.020
...the dream and the reality...

00:02:35.020 --> 00:02:38.650
...that you saw cross paths

00:02:38.820 --> 00:02:42.350
Some light is shed...

00:02:43.030 --> 00:02:46.930
...but how it is done is unknown...

00:02:46.930 --> 00:02:54.170
...so that we can go to a different place

00:02:54.640 --> 00:03:02.170
The things I want have no shape

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:10.580
Tear the final universe, today until tomorrow

00:03:21.230 --> 00:03:24.670
Vital Guarder

00:03:27.370 --> 00:03:28.800
Why'd we lose gravity?

00:03:28.800 --> 00:03:30.340
Criff! Help!

00:03:30.340 --> 00:03:31.870
I can't reach you!

00:03:31.870 --> 00:03:34.740
Get in your seat and pull the right
lever! You'll be secured automatically.

00:03:34.740 --> 00:03:35.340
Kouji!

00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:35.830
Thank you.

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:39.270
Hey! What caused this?

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:43.350
The main source of Ryvius stopped upon
its separation with the Lift-ship.

00:03:44.090 --> 00:03:45.420
We're currently using the backup.

00:03:45.950 --> 00:03:48.860
Are you saying the ship's control system
was located within the Vital Guarder?

00:03:49.260 --> 00:03:50.750
I believe it would be safe to assume so.

00:03:51.590 --> 00:03:55.260
I will activate the support power
to reestablish gravity. Kreis.

00:03:55.730 --> 00:03:56.770
Right.

00:03:56.770 --> 00:03:59.100
Hey. How do you think
things are within the ship?

00:03:59.100 --> 00:04:00.000
I'd rather not think about it.

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:03.900
- What's going on?
- Help!

00:04:05.270 --> 00:04:07.370
My music chips!

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:10.410
Somebody! Help! HELP!

00:04:10.780 --> 00:04:13.150
How come I'm on duty
at a time like this?

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:18.350
Could this mean we've already
entered our next battle?

00:04:18.350 --> 00:04:19.720
No way! I can't have that!

00:04:20.720 --> 00:04:22.620
What's going on, Kouji?

00:04:24.260 --> 00:04:27.660
I'll just bet Aoi's saying
something about me right now.

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:29.430
Does that bother you?

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:31.900
Ah, no. No. It's nothing like that.

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:37.040
You've run Kreis's Solid, right?

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:38.670
Just do as we've practiced, and
you should be able to activate it!

00:04:38.970 --> 00:04:42.970
Damn. This solid is so
difficult to use! Sub-room!

00:04:43.610 --> 00:04:46.210
<i>Try and program this properly!</i>
<i>If you don't wanna die, that is!</i>

00:04:46.650 --> 00:04:48.120
He says to do it properly.

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:50.690
I'm gonna kill that brat myself
once this battle is over!

00:04:50.690 --> 00:04:53.450
Well, um... he means no harm.

00:04:56.590 --> 00:04:58.720
Is that thing really
gonna move with this?

00:04:59.060 --> 00:05:01.390
Stop complaining and do it, idiot.

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:02.930
Who you calling "idiot"?

00:05:02.930 --> 00:05:06.890
Stop it! You sure we can get this
moving before the enemy arrives?!

00:05:07.100 --> 00:05:08.590
Don't worry! Another five minutes!

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:16.370
Support power adjustments,
now surpassing 87 percent.

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:19.110
Transferring solid for gravity field.

00:05:19.510 --> 00:05:21.780
Is this really the correct solution?

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:23.110
Be confident in your resolution.

00:05:24.390 --> 00:05:26.550
Hesitation and anxiety will
only weaken your determination.

00:05:27.420 --> 00:05:29.520
Another precept of Holy Mother Arne?

00:05:30.590 --> 00:05:33.490
Arne's words will provide us with the
courage to live through difficulties.

00:05:36.670 --> 00:05:37.650
Wh-What the hell?!

00:05:37.930 --> 00:05:41.030
Oh, I'm sorry! I've
brought you your meals!

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:43.500
H-Hey! A-Aoi!

00:05:44.310 --> 00:05:45.240
What are you doing here?

00:05:45.470 --> 00:05:46.440
How'd you get in?

00:05:46.540 --> 00:05:48.440
Huh? How'd I get in?

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:50.080
Like anyone would get in.

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:52.170
Like any...?! But Ryu and the others
were guarding the entrance, right?!

00:05:52.310 --> 00:05:53.580
Do something about this?

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:55.080
- Calm down.
- Get your arm out of here.

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:56.550
- I can't undo the button.
- Your leg's hitting.

00:05:56.890 --> 00:05:58.440
What's going on with
Ryu and the others?

00:05:58.790 --> 00:05:59.380
Umm...

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:01.720
Hand them out, and get outta here!

00:06:02.020 --> 00:06:02.890
Okay!

00:06:03.120 --> 00:06:05.750
Damn. I didn't expect her
to come all the way here.

00:06:06.360 --> 00:06:07.450
Here Kouji, one for you!

00:06:09.100 --> 00:06:11.000
Kouji. What in the world's happening?

00:06:11.430 --> 00:06:13.130
As announced. Enemies
are on their way here.

00:06:13.570 --> 00:06:14.760
I want details.

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:18.070
There's no time for that. Stop
sticking around, and leave.

00:06:20.040 --> 00:06:20.740
Where's Ikumi?

00:06:23.140 --> 00:06:24.410
Ah, he's over there.

00:06:24.410 --> 00:06:25.110
What's that?

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:27.180
Is Ikumi on that?

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:28.680
Yeah.

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:29.480
Yuki too?

00:06:31.250 --> 00:06:32.920
He's also on it, isn't he?

00:06:32.920 --> 00:06:35.360
Okay, everything's in
place! Proceed to lift off.

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:36.820
Commencing countdown!

00:06:37.190 --> 00:06:40.130
7, 6, 5...

00:06:40.130 --> 00:06:43.590
...4, 3, 2, 1.

00:06:44.100 --> 00:06:45.760
Opening mechanical sections!

00:06:58.310 --> 00:06:59.750
Reactor output 87.

00:07:06.860 --> 00:07:07.950
Control solid stable.

00:07:10.890 --> 00:07:12.190
Respective fixes being released.

00:07:21.240 --> 00:07:22.790
Opening of all outer sections complete!

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:25.340
- Send it out!
- Lift off!

00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:26.530
Vital Guarder!

00:07:28.540 --> 00:07:29.410
Lift off!

00:07:57.010 --> 00:07:58.340
It's a robot!

00:07:58.340 --> 00:07:58.810
Yeah.

00:07:59.440 --> 00:08:01.340
This is too ludicrous!

00:08:03.280 --> 00:08:05.250
Is this thing for real?

00:08:07.950 --> 00:08:09.080
I'm terribly sorry.

00:08:09.080 --> 00:08:13.120
I was busy gazing at the thing and forgot
to tell you that gravity would be restored.

00:08:13.120 --> 00:08:14.590
What about links to the
respective operations?

00:08:14.590 --> 00:08:15.990
I'm completing them now.

00:08:15.990 --> 00:08:18.730
It's been set at 3.5. There are no mistakes
with these default settings, I hope.

00:08:18.730 --> 00:08:22.860
As long as I can override
all programs, that's fine.

00:08:22.860 --> 00:08:25.030
Don't worry about the rest!

00:08:25.030 --> 00:08:28.940
Wow! Those lights from
the attached strings...

00:08:30.910 --> 00:08:32.700
Don't you find that robot kinda slow?

00:08:33.310 --> 00:08:35.580
You may not notice it because
of the relative distance...

00:08:35.580 --> 00:08:37.110
...but it's accelerating at 20 G.

00:08:37.110 --> 00:08:38.980
If anyone were riding the Vital
Guarder, they'd be killed instantly.

00:08:39.850 --> 00:08:41.580
Are you sure things will be okay?

00:08:41.850 --> 00:08:42.850
Excuse me!

00:08:42.850 --> 00:08:43.790
What?

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:45.690
Which are you worried for?

00:08:46.190 --> 00:08:47.420
Kouji, or Kouji's...

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:49.190
Seven heat sources
confirmed approaching us!

00:08:49.690 --> 00:08:51.260
It's the fleet that we encountered earlier.

00:08:51.260 --> 00:08:52.990
10 minutes and 30
seconds before contact!

00:08:54.460 --> 00:08:57.200
They appear to be mines! They're
scattered all along our orbit!

00:08:57.200 --> 00:08:58.390
We could get killed at this rate!

00:08:58.900 --> 00:09:00.140
Sorry we're late!

00:09:00.140 --> 00:09:01.070
What's been happening?

00:09:01.070 --> 00:09:04.600
We're under attack! Can't you make
yourselves more useful around here?

00:09:05.810 --> 00:09:07.540
Counterattack with the Vital Guarder!

00:09:07.740 --> 00:09:10.370
<i>Lift-ship here. Roger. We've</i>
<i>also located moving objects.</i>

00:09:10.850 --> 00:09:12.780
<i>We're entering counterattack</i>
<i>phase with Code 4.</i>

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:18.550
Two minutes before they get here!

00:09:18.550 --> 00:09:20.320
Concentrate gravity field to right arm.

00:09:20.320 --> 00:09:23.460
Change focus on field accordingly
to destroy mines as they arrive.

00:09:23.460 --> 00:09:24.660
Easy for you to say!

00:09:24.660 --> 00:09:27.400
I don't wanna die acting
as a shield to Ryvius!

00:09:27.400 --> 00:09:28.990
Hey! We're on this
thing to protect them!

00:09:29.360 --> 00:09:30.490
Focus on the job at hand!

00:09:36.910 --> 00:09:38.700
There are too many mines to mark.

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:40.400
Arriving in 45 seconds!

00:09:47.350 --> 00:09:49.180
The main body's not operating
in sync with the model.

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:51.110
Sub-room! What's going on?

00:09:51.790 --> 00:09:53.150
<i>Do you guys wanna die?</i>

00:09:53.250 --> 00:09:54.780
Hey, hey! This isn't funny!

00:09:59.130 --> 00:10:00.690
You're hurting me, Juli.

00:10:05.230 --> 00:10:06.700
- Ikumi!
- Yuki!

00:10:37.570 --> 00:10:39.230
Placing battle stance on temporary hold.

00:10:40.130 --> 00:10:41.760
C-Cool!

00:10:41.840 --> 00:10:42.870
We did it!

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:44.800
We got 'em!

00:10:47.440 --> 00:10:49.500
<i>What incredible power!</i>

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:07.650
This robot... is awesome.

00:11:14.740 --> 00:11:16.260
Infinite Ryvius

00:11:19.840 --> 00:11:20.970
Infinite Ryvius

00:11:24.510 --> 00:11:29.150
Optical observations show an
instant acceleration of thirty Gs.

00:11:29.150 --> 00:11:31.690
We did not detect any infrared reaction.

00:11:31.690 --> 00:11:33.020
What are the estimated strengths
of the enemy's weapon?

00:11:33.590 --> 00:11:36.060
Judging from the density
of neutrino in the area...

00:11:36.060 --> 00:11:38.460
...it's believed to be inertia
control using gravitational field.

00:11:39.290 --> 00:11:40.280
Some new weapon...!

00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:43.000
Enemy vessel has passed
orbit transfer point!

00:11:43.000 --> 00:11:46.060
Expected to reach our fleet's
core in one hour and 52 minutes!

00:11:46.400 --> 00:11:48.340
Adjust reencounter distance to 20,000!

00:11:48.800 --> 00:11:51.700
Send all observation
data to the Wells Ring!

00:11:52.240 --> 00:11:53.670
All units, prepare to attack!

00:11:58.350 --> 00:12:00.210
You sure we can afford to
take time like this to rest?

00:12:00.980 --> 00:12:03.250
Unless we get rested now,
the guys won't last.

00:12:03.620 --> 00:12:05.780
It takes time to fight
a battle in outer space.

00:12:06.250 --> 00:12:10.330
<i>Come on! Stop scaring me</i>
<i>like that, stupid Ikumi!</i>

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:13.130
Is that any way to speak to
someone desperately doing his best?

00:12:13.130 --> 00:12:14.590
<i>But I was so scared!</i>

00:12:15.260 --> 00:12:16.920
We successfully
protected you, didn't we?

00:12:17.770 --> 00:12:20.640
I'm not talking about the end result,
but what happened in between!

00:12:20.640 --> 00:12:22.170
<i>What do you mean by that?</i>

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:23.760
You spent all that time practicing.

00:12:23.940 --> 00:12:25.770
- In which case, you should've done better.
- Kouji, do something about her.

00:12:26.170 --> 00:12:28.340
- You seemed to take forever!
- There isn't much I can do...

00:12:28.340 --> 00:12:31.400
In any case, if you're gonna
protect us, do it right!

00:12:32.280 --> 00:12:34.040
Trying to catch his attention.

00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:36.610
How noble.

00:12:36.750 --> 00:12:39.580
That's not it! Not at all!

00:12:39.990 --> 00:12:42.390
That's enough. Ryvius here.

00:12:42.860 --> 00:12:44.830
<i>The Lift-ship is to standby</i>
<i>in its present state.</i>

00:12:45.390 --> 00:12:47.960
<i>We will check on the enemy</i>
<i>from here using our radar.</i>

00:12:47.960 --> 00:12:48.830
Roger.

00:12:48.830 --> 00:12:50.960
Sub-room! Break for your meal
now, while we have a chance!

00:12:51.600 --> 00:12:52.220
How are things over there?

00:12:52.770 --> 00:12:54.170
<i>Well, at first... Huh?</i>

00:12:54.800 --> 00:12:56.670
<i>Kouji. You need to switch</i>
<i>it to private transmission.</i>

00:12:57.710 --> 00:12:58.540
<i>S- Sorry.</i>

00:12:59.240 --> 00:13:01.110
There was some confusion at first,
but things have settled down now.

00:13:01.110 --> 00:13:06.270
I see. That's good to hear. Oh,
and tell Kozue not to worry.

00:13:06.650 --> 00:13:08.140
<i>Why not tell her yourself? Bye.</i>

00:13:08.450 --> 00:13:10.520
Huh? Hey! Wait a minute! Kouji!

00:13:10.520 --> 00:13:11.990
<i>I thought you were</i>
<i>supposed to be a hostage.</i>

00:13:13.020 --> 00:13:14.220
Boy, I'm hungry!

00:13:14.220 --> 00:13:16.020
Hey, that's mine!

00:13:16.420 --> 00:13:18.520
You need to go on a diet, you know.

00:13:20.730 --> 00:13:21.920
That was easy.

00:13:22.130 --> 00:13:24.690
You're not a Zwei member for
nothing. Here, you deserve a break.

00:13:24.900 --> 00:13:27.200
No. We owe it all to the
abilities of the Vital Guarder.

00:13:27.800 --> 00:13:31.240
With this, we can do anything.
Whether it be battling or escaping.

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:37.110
Pat. Do you know where the bathroom is?

00:13:37.510 --> 00:13:38.600
Mhm. I know.

00:13:39.010 --> 00:13:41.450
Hey, Kozue. Ikumi says not to worry.

00:13:42.980 --> 00:13:44.650
What do you think of the Vital Guarder?

00:13:45.750 --> 00:13:47.480
Results exceeded all calculations.

00:13:47.860 --> 00:13:49.150
It's too strong.

00:13:49.590 --> 00:13:50.990
Too much power for us to manage.

00:13:53.190 --> 00:13:54.160
Hey.

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:56.060
Yes?

00:13:56.400 --> 00:13:59.390
You were about to say
something earlier. What was it?

00:14:00.500 --> 00:14:01.990
It's all right now.

00:14:03.140 --> 00:14:06.440
Come on. Now I wanna know even more.

00:14:06.640 --> 00:14:09.270
You're done here, so why
don't you get out, Aoi?

00:14:09.540 --> 00:14:10.640
Yeah, I know!

00:14:11.010 --> 00:14:13.380
Didn't think you had so much
control over your girl.

00:14:14.120 --> 00:14:15.780
We've been friends since
we were little. That's all.

00:14:15.780 --> 00:14:19.810
Everyone! Stop slacking off and
focus on the present situation!

00:14:20.150 --> 00:14:22.050
We're not outta the woods yet!

00:14:26.290 --> 00:14:28.020
I'm back from the bathroom.

00:14:31.530 --> 00:14:34.640
Way to go, Charlie!

00:14:34.640 --> 00:14:36.930
Stop calling me Charlie!

00:14:38.210 --> 00:14:39.540
Well? Any response?

00:14:39.940 --> 00:14:41.440
Well, no problem at the moment...!

00:14:41.440 --> 00:14:44.100
You've got the detection range set at
minimum! What the hell are you doing?

00:14:44.680 --> 00:14:46.370
Oops, I'm terribly sorry.

00:14:46.650 --> 00:14:48.410
Enemy attack!

00:14:48.780 --> 00:14:51.450
There are enough mines lying out
there to completely cover our route!

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:54.350
Their fleet is accelerating.
Fleet consists of seven vessels.

00:14:54.620 --> 00:14:55.960
Won't they ever quit?

00:14:55.960 --> 00:14:59.190
Let's change our route. We should be
able to alter our route within an hour.

00:14:59.590 --> 00:15:02.150
I was just thinking the same
thing. I agree with you.

00:15:03.400 --> 00:15:05.520
Make the Vital Guarder
create a route for us!

00:15:06.270 --> 00:15:07.200
What are you saying?

00:15:07.200 --> 00:15:09.740
We'll tear through the minefield
and rip the enemy apart.

00:15:09.740 --> 00:15:14.080
Come on. Do you seriously think we can
fight them alone? They're professio...!

00:15:14.080 --> 00:15:17.200
The only way we can stop their
attack is to crush their fleet!

00:15:17.710 --> 00:15:19.350
Stop disagreeing just for
the sake of disagreeing!

00:15:19.350 --> 00:15:22.540
That's exactly why you Zweis
end up screwing things up!

00:15:29.690 --> 00:15:31.030
Before we decide on
whether or not to attack...

00:15:31.030 --> 00:15:34.190
...I believe we've gotta think
about getting past the minefield.

00:15:35.460 --> 00:15:36.560
We need to think about surviving.

00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:42.500
<i>This is Ryvius calling. Take the alternate</i>
<i>route I sent to evade the minefield.</i>

00:15:43.070 --> 00:15:46.010
<i>Please work on getting rid of just the</i>
<i>mines around us with the Vital Guarder.</i>

00:15:46.610 --> 00:15:48.670
Kouji! Do you realize
how many there are?

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:50.170
<i>Do as you're told, Son!</i>

00:15:51.010 --> 00:15:52.310
We can't make it
through on this route!

00:15:52.510 --> 00:15:54.170
It is the safest course!

00:15:54.680 --> 00:15:57.050
It's obvious that the enemy's trying
to lure us into this direction.

00:15:57.590 --> 00:15:58.850
You guys blind?

00:15:59.150 --> 00:16:01.710
Stop complaining! Just do as you're told!

00:16:02.090 --> 00:16:05.020
<i>Who do you think you are?</i>
<i>You're just the operator!</i>

00:16:05.360 --> 00:16:07.020
<i>You're only watching things</i>
<i>unfold from a distance!</i>

00:16:07.360 --> 00:16:08.560
<i>These are bridge orders!</i>

00:16:08.560 --> 00:16:09.690
<i>I'm telling you, I refuse!</i>

00:16:10.330 --> 00:16:10.850
Yuki!

00:16:12.430 --> 00:16:13.230
<i>Yuki!</i>

00:16:13.830 --> 00:16:16.270
<i>We came to this decision as a
<i>group, so do as you're told!</i></i>

00:16:16.540 --> 00:16:18.330
<i>This is no time to be selfish!</i>

00:16:18.570 --> 00:16:20.340
Aoi. Why are you...?

00:16:20.340 --> 00:16:21.210
<i>Stay outta this!</i>

00:16:21.210 --> 00:16:23.140
<i>But...! Are you listening, Yuki?</i>

00:16:23.140 --> 00:16:24.510
<i>Go back to your quarters, dimwit!</i>

00:16:24.950 --> 00:16:26.310
I don't believe it...!

00:16:26.310 --> 00:16:27.840
<i>Aoi, stay out of this!</i>

00:16:28.120 --> 00:16:30.140
<i>Right! You're only getting in our way!</i>

00:16:30.320 --> 00:16:31.820
<i>What do you mean I'm in your way?</i>

00:16:31.820 --> 00:16:33.420
<i>This place is OUR place!</i>

00:16:33.420 --> 00:16:34.750
Bastard!

00:16:37.190 --> 00:16:38.530
- What?
- What's going on?

00:16:38.530 --> 00:16:41.090
A conversion program...!
When did Yuki create this?

00:16:48.170 --> 00:16:51.000
The Vital Guarder is heading to
where the layer is the thickest.

00:16:51.340 --> 00:16:52.640
What about our plan?

00:16:52.640 --> 00:16:54.270
What's gotten into your brother!

00:16:54.910 --> 00:16:55.680
Sorry.

00:16:55.680 --> 00:16:59.480
Without the Vital Guarder, our
weapons are practically useless. Blue.

00:16:59.480 --> 00:17:00.650
What's happening? We're doomed!

00:17:00.650 --> 00:17:01.810
Yuki Aiba.

00:17:06.650 --> 00:17:08.850
Yuki! Switch control back to me!

00:17:09.020 --> 00:17:10.860
Yuki! Stop it!

00:17:10.860 --> 00:17:11.950
What'll we do, Blue?

00:17:15.060 --> 00:17:16.690
I'll let him do as he wishes.

00:17:17.870 --> 00:17:20.030
The responsibility is with them anyway.

00:17:20.030 --> 00:17:22.370
This will give us a chance to test
the Vital Guarder's abilities.

00:17:23.170 --> 00:17:25.430
Have you got no concern for others?

00:17:26.810 --> 00:17:29.540
We'll use them as a shield
to get past the minefield.

00:17:30.210 --> 00:17:32.180
They're not using any defensive
field! They'll be destroyed!

00:17:32.410 --> 00:17:33.680
This is suicide!

00:17:33.680 --> 00:17:36.340
If they are destroyed, we're next!

00:17:36.720 --> 00:17:37.820
Then what's gonna happen to us?

00:17:37.820 --> 00:17:41.950
Heiger! Shouldn't you stop
them? I don't wanna die here!

00:17:42.060 --> 00:17:46.290
No, I don't wanna die! You feel the
same, right? I'm sure you do! Right?

00:17:46.560 --> 00:17:47.960
Shut up, you piece of dirt!

00:17:49.830 --> 00:17:51.160
The correct decision has been made!

00:17:52.130 --> 00:17:52.930
Heiger...!

00:17:53.270 --> 00:17:54.890
At least, I believe so.

00:17:56.940 --> 00:18:00.370
<i>Is he saying Yuki's decision is</i>
<i>correct? Not mine, but Yuki's?</i>

00:18:04.110 --> 00:18:05.140
J85!

00:18:05.550 --> 00:18:08.850
I sent it! You just
concentrate on what you see.

00:18:09.520 --> 00:18:12.420
I'll send you the best Solid for the job! All
I ask in return is that you protect all of us.

00:18:12.820 --> 00:18:14.720
No matter what we encounter,
be sure to protect us all!

00:18:24.270 --> 00:18:26.760
Minefield course and interception point.

00:18:26.930 --> 00:18:28.370
12 degrees by 6.8.

00:18:28.370 --> 00:18:29.800
Coming at us!

00:18:29.800 --> 00:18:34.800
Remain on our present course!

00:18:40.610 --> 00:18:42.550
All vessels, fire anti-ship missiles!

00:18:43.380 --> 00:18:44.650
All vessels, fire!

00:18:50.260 --> 00:18:51.660
Damn it! Missiles!

00:18:51.860 --> 00:18:52.930
From above?

00:18:52.930 --> 00:18:54.190
Send over A43!

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:55.860
And the YK Solid!

00:18:55.860 --> 00:18:57.330
Do something, Yuki!

00:18:59.800 --> 00:19:01.740
It's gonna be a direct hit!
We're not gonna make it!

00:19:01.740 --> 00:19:02.670
Shut up!

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:06.210
I told you that you should follow orders!

00:19:08.840 --> 00:19:09.540
Sister!

00:19:11.680 --> 00:19:13.040
GO!!

00:19:32.470 --> 00:19:34.960
<i>Why do you suppose we're siblings?</i>

00:19:36.870 --> 00:19:38.030
<i>I never really thought about it.</i>

00:19:39.240 --> 00:19:41.500
<i>I just can't stand it.</i>

00:19:42.410 --> 00:19:43.770
<i>You weren't even serious.</i>

00:19:44.880 --> 00:19:46.540
<i>One day, when I become an officer.</i>

00:19:47.380 --> 00:19:49.580
<i>S- Stop it. I beg you.</i>

00:19:50.420 --> 00:19:51.940
<i>Why does it have to be him?</i>

00:19:52.790 --> 00:19:53.750
<i>Good-bye.</i>

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:57.050
<i>All I want is to be together.</i>

00:20:04.670 --> 00:20:05.870
We got past!

00:20:05.870 --> 00:20:07.200
I'm not done yet!

00:20:18.380 --> 00:20:21.470
<i>We're being drawn by their weapon.</i>
<i>We're being forced out of orbit!</i>

00:20:21.920 --> 00:20:23.210
Stop it! Don't kill them!

00:20:23.520 --> 00:20:24.680
Be quiet! I can't concentrate!

00:20:32.490 --> 00:20:35.760
Enemy fleet is moving away from
orbit. No chance of them returning.

00:20:36.030 --> 00:20:37.000
All right!

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:38.970
Hurray! We've won!

00:20:44.270 --> 00:20:46.470
<i>If the course of the enemy was</i>
<i>altered, we'd be protected.</i>

00:20:47.310 --> 00:20:48.670
<i>So that's what you had in mind, Yuki.</i>

00:21:02.020 --> 00:21:04.820
Captain Conrad! Vaia has
been completely activated!

00:21:05.030 --> 00:21:05.890
Vaia?

00:21:09.600 --> 00:21:13.560
We will commence operation when our
distance from Bratica reaches five digits.

00:21:13.900 --> 00:21:15.430
Yes, sir.

00:21:18.540 --> 00:21:20.440
<i>As long as Bratica's without Vaia...</i>

00:21:21.380 --> 00:21:24.380
The vessel we first encountered
is making a trip around the planet...

00:21:24.380 --> 00:21:26.050
...and is heading toward us again.

00:21:26.050 --> 00:21:27.810
Estimated time of encounter in four hours.

00:21:28.150 --> 00:21:29.550
What do you plan to do, Blue?

00:21:29.650 --> 00:21:32.590
If they come at us, we'll just counter
them again with the Vital Guarder.

00:21:35.020 --> 00:21:35.690
What's wrong?

00:21:35.690 --> 00:21:37.760
Communication Data from the Lift-ship
has been interrupted.

00:21:37.760 --> 00:21:38.590
Due to the Geduld?

00:21:38.590 --> 00:21:40.090
I'll check it out.

00:21:40.090 --> 00:21:41.220
We can't contact them?

00:21:41.760 --> 00:21:42.490
The enemy's coming.

00:21:45.800 --> 00:21:49.790
Wells Ring's course confirmed. We will
proceed with the feint operation.

00:22:07.810 --> 00:22:12.080
In your dry eyes...

00:22:12.080 --> 00:22:17.150
...a silhouette appears

00:22:17.150 --> 00:22:21.860
The blue colored future...

00:22:21.860 --> 00:22:28.590
...swayed and glittered

00:22:29.760 --> 00:22:38.010
Ah... No one wants...

00:22:38.010 --> 00:22:46.610
...freedom out of pity

00:22:46.610 --> 00:22:55.060
Ah... To the days I feared...

00:22:55.060 --> 00:22:58.960
...that I'd end up hurting someone,

00:22:58.960 --> 00:23:05.330
goodbye

00:23:09.190 --> 00:23:11.160
Infinite Ryvius

00:23:11.160 --> 00:23:11.590
Infinite Ryvius
Next episode: Even If I Can't Believe

00:23:11.590 --> 00:23:12.660
Next episode: Even If I Can't Believe

00:23:12.660 --> 00:23:15.700
Next episode: Even If I Can't Believe
We've lost contact with the Lift-ship,
which steers the Vital Guarder.

00:23:15.700 --> 00:23:16.630
Next episode: Even If I Can't Believe

00:23:16.630 --> 00:23:18.500
Next episode: Even If I Can't Believe
The situation complicates the thoughts
of the many people on board Ryvius...

00:23:18.500 --> 00:23:18.700
Next episode: Even If I Can't Believe

00:23:18.700 --> 00:23:21.270
Next episode: Even If I Can't Believe
...itself hopeless with no combat ability.

00:23:21.270 --> 00:23:21.300
Next episode: Even If I Can't Believe

00:23:21.300 --> 00:23:24.100
Next episode: Even If I Can't Believe
I believe... even if I can no longer
believe in people...

00:23:24.100 --> 00:23:24.770
Next episode: Even If I Can't Believe

00:23:24.770 --> 00:23:25.940
Next episode: Even If I Can't Believe
...even if I can no longer
believe in tomorrow...

00:23:25.940 --> 00:23:26.770
Next episode: Even If I Can't Believe

00:23:26.770 --> 00:23:28.670
Next episode: Even If I Can't Believe
...I believe in what I can do right now.

00:23:28.670 --> 00:23:29.440
Next episode: Even If I Can't Believe
